k=a7?"\xc7awa t\xea l\xeestin?":"Nas\u0131l oynan\u0131r?"
j=a7?"\u2022 P\xea\u015fbirka Bilez: tavil\xea 10 pirsan bibersiv\xeene.\n\u2022 P\xea\u015fbirka Roj\xea: her roj ji bo hem\xfb l\xeestikvanan heman 10 pirs.\n\u2022 Odeyek Ava Bike: kod\xea bide heval\xean xwe \xfb bi hev re bil\xeezin.\n\u2022 Kategor\xee \xfb Ast: ji 8 kategoriyan \xfb 5 astan hilbij\xeare.\n\u2022 Joker 50/50: du bersiv\xean \u015fa\u015f radike.\n\u2022 Bersiv\xean rast p\xfban \xfb coin dide; r\xeaza rast bonus z\xeade dike.":"\u2022 H\u0131zl\u0131 Yar\u0131\u015f: hemen 10 soru cevapla.\n\u2022 G\xfcn\xfcn Yar\u0131\u015fmas\u0131: her g\xfcn t\xfcm oyunculara ayn\u0131 10 soru.\n\u2022 Oda Kur: kodu arkada\u015flar\u0131na ver, birlikte yar\u0131\u015f\u0131n.\n\u2022 Kategori ve Seviye: 8 kategori, 5 seviye aras\u0131ndan se\xe7.\n\u2022 50/50 jokeri iki yanl\u0131\u015f cevab\u0131 eler.\n\u2022 Do\u011fru cevap puan ve coin kazand\u0131r\u0131r; seri bonusu art\u0131r\u0131r."
i=a7?"Nepen\xee":"Gizlilik"
h=a7?"ZanKurd ev dane tomar dike: nav\xea l\xeestikvan, navn\xee\u015fana e-peyam\xea (heke tomar bib\xee), p\xfban \xfb stat\xeest\xeek\xean l\xeestik\xea, hejmara coinan \xfb pirs\xean tomarkir\xee. Di xetayan de tomar\xean tekn\xeek\xee y\xean anon\xeem t\xean berhevkirin.\n\nDaney\xean te nay\xean firotin \xfb ji bo reklam\xea bi kes\xean s\xeayem\xeen re nay\xean parvekirin. Nav\xea te ten\xea di tabloya p\xea\u015fder\xe7\xfbn\xea de xuya dibe.\n\nJi bo j\xeabirina hesab\xea \xfb hem\xfb daneyan: nisebinbawer47@gmail.com":"ZanKurd \u015fu verileri saklar: oyuncu ad\u0131, e-posta adresi (kay\u0131t olursan), oyun puanlar\u0131 ve istatistikleri, coin bakiyesi ve kaydedilen sorular. Hatalarda anonim teknik \xe7\xf6kme kay\u0131tlar\u0131 toplan\u0131r.\n\nVerilerin sat\u0131lmaz ve \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc taraflarla pazarlama ama\xe7l\u0131 payla\u015f\u0131lmaz. Ad\u0131n yaln\u0131zca liderlik tablosunda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.\n\nHesab\u0131n\u0131 ve t\xfcm verilerini kal\u0131c\u0131 sildirmek i\xe7in: nisebinbawer47@gmail.com"
