irina rast ji bo 'Peymana Lozan\xea' ev e: peymana navdewlet\xee ya sala 1923an ku Kurdistan li ser \xe7ar dewletan dabe\u015f kir.",qK:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'Qerejdax' ev e: \xe7iyay\xea volkan\xeek \xea bazalt\xee ku de\u015fta Amed\xea ji ya rihay\xea vediqet\xeene.",zC:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'Radikal demokrasi' ev e: teoriya siyas\xee ya ku be\u015fdariya rasterast a gel di biryaran de dipar\xeaze.",BC:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'Rojnameya Kurdistan' ev e: rojnameya yekem a kurd\xee ku di sala 1898an de li Qah\xeerey\xea ji aliy\xea M\xeeqdat M\xeedhad Bedirxan ve hat we\u015fandin.",JG:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'Saz\xeeb\xfbna Dengb\xeajiy\xea' ev e: kela parastina ziman \xfb d\xeerok\xea ku bi riya stran \xfb klam\xean dengb\xeajan t\xea me\u015fandin.",jn:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'Selahedd\xeen\xea Ey\xfbb\xee' ev e: serok\xea mezin \xea kurd ku Quds ji xa\xe7perestan rizgar kir \xfb xanedaniya Ey\xfbbiyan ava kir.",uo:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'aboriya kom\xfbnal' ev e: modela aboriy\xea ya ku li ser bingeha parvekirin \xfb hewcedariy\xea ava bile ne li ser qezenc\xea.",uU:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'ademi-merkeziyet' ev e: parvekirina desthilat\xea ji navend\xea ber bi her\xeam \xfb r\xeaveberiy\xean xweser ve.",t8:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'azadiya zayend\xee' ev e: prens\xeeba azadiya jin \xfb m\xear \xfb wekheviya wan a di her qada jiyan\xea de.",NV:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'bil\xfbr' ev e: am\xfbra bay\xea ya \xe7obanan ku bi deng\xea xwe y\xea xemg\xeen \xfb l\xeerik t\xea naskirin.",zM:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'civaka exlaq\xee-pol\xeet\xeek' ev e: civaka azad a ku biryar\xean xwe bi hi\u015fmendiya exlak\xee \xfb pol\xeet\xeek dide.",Q2:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'c\xeenavk\xean kesane' ev e: n\xee\u015fander\xean wek\xee 'ez, tu, ew, em, h\xfbn, ew' \xean ku bo kesan t\xean bikaran\xeen.",oQ:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'c\xeenavk\xean tewand\xee' ev e: c\xeenavk\xean wek\xee 'min, te, w\xee, w\xea, me, we, wan' ku di bin tewandin\xea de ne.",bW:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'da\xe7ek\xean hevedudan\xee' ev e: peyv\xean wek\xee 'di... de, bi... re, ji... re' ku t\xeakiliy\xean cih n\xee\u015fan didin.",kb:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'dema bor\xee ya d\xfbr' ev e: avahiya l\xeaker\xea ya ku kiryarek di rabird\xfbyeke pir d\xfbr de n\xee\u015fan dide.",FQ:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'demokrasiya rasterast' ev e: \u015f\xeawaz\xea r\xeaveberiy\xea ku t\xea de gel b\xeay\xee n\xfbneran biryaran dide.",GQ:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'erbane' ev e: am\xfbra l\xeadan\xea ya zildar ku di muz\xeeka kurd\xee ya ol\xee \xfb gel\xear\xee de xwed\xee cihek\xee gir\xeeng e.",nb:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'ergat\xeef' ev e: avahiya r\xeaziman\xee ya ku kirdeya l\xeaker\xean gerguh\xeaz di dema bor\xee de tewand\xee n\xee\u015fan dide.",fR:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'ezafe' ev e: t\xeakiliya art\xeala m\xea (a) \xfb n\xear (\xea) ya ku navd\xearan bi hev ve gir\xea dide.",DG:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'e\u015fserokt\xee' ev e: s\xeestema hevseng a ku t\xea de jin \xfb m\xear bi hev re di hem\xfb saziyan de seroktiy\xea dikin.",m0:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'hevpeymaniya demokrat\xeek' ev e: t\xeakiliya stratej\xeek a di navbera h\xeaz\xean guhertin\xea y\xea civak\xea de.",rw:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'hewran' ev e: \xe7adira re\u015f a ku ji m\xfby\xea bizinan t\xea \xe7\xeakirin \xfb ko\xe7eran ji germ \xfb sermay\xea dipar\xeaze.",IR:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'heyran' ev e: klam\xean ev\xeen\xea y\xean devera Serhad\xea ku bi taybet\xee ji aliy\xea jinan ve dihatin gotin.",Ki:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'hiyerar\u015fiya civak\xee' ev e: avahiya serdestiy\xea ya ku civak\xea dabe\u015f\xee \xe7\xeen\xean jor \xfb j\xear dike.",hh:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'kilim\xean kurd\xee' ev e: elhunera kevnar a jin\xean kurd ku mot\xeef\xean li ser wan \xe7\xeerok\xean d\xeerok\xee vedib\xeajin.",cA:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'kom\xfbn \xfb mecl\xees' ev e: avahiy\xean her\xee bingeh\xeen \xean xwe-r\xeaveberiya gel li tax \xfb gundan.",SR:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'kovara Hawar\xea' ev e: kovara edeb\xee \xfb \xe7and\xee ya ku di sala 1932an de li \u015eam\xea bi dest\xea Bedirxaniyan derketiye.",jY:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'lawik' ev e: \u015f\xeawaz\xea muz\xeeka dengb\xeajiy\xea y\xea ku li ser lehengiya m\xearan \xfb \u015feran t\xea gotin.",qI:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'l\xeakera gerguh\xeaz' ev e: l\xeaker\xean ku hewcedariya wan bi art\xeala tewand\xee heye bo temamkirina watey\xea.",Wt:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'l\xeer\xeeka klaman' ev e: avahiya helbest\xee ya kilam\xean dengb\xeajiy\xea ku \xe7\xeerok\xean ev\xeen \xfb \u015feran vedib\xeajin.",Xp:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'misafirperweriya kurd\xee' ev e: t\xeakiliya civak\xee ya ku t\xea de m\xeavan wek\xee bereketa mal\xea t\xea qeb\xfbl kirin.",JI:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'parastina rewa' ev e: maf\xea parastina xwezay\xee ya civak\xea li dij\xee \xear\xee\u015f\xean dervey\xee.",e3:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'pa\u015fgir\xean tewandin\xea' ev e: h\xeaman\xean wek\xee '-\xee, -\xea, -an' ku di tewandina navd\xearan de cih digirin.",FN:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'peymana civak\xee' ev e: belgeya bingeh\xeen a ku prens\xeeb\xean jiyana hevbe\u015f \xfb azad a gelan diyar dike.",UD:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'pirreng\xee' ev e: prens\xeeba parastin \xfb pejirandina hem\xfb nasnamey\xean cuda y\xea di civak\xea de.",vr:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'rexneya patriyarkay\xea' ev e: anal\xeezkirin \xfb hilwe\u015fandina s\xeestema serdest a m\xear a li ser civak\xea.",FC:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'r\xeaniv\xeesa Hawar\xea' ev e: pergala alfabeya kurd\xee ya bi t\xeep\xean lat\xeen\xee ku ji aliy\xea Celadet Bedirxan ve hatib\xfb amadekirin.",qn:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'temb\xfbr' ev e: am\xfbra muz\xeek\xea ya her\xee p\xeeroz \xfb kevnar a kurd\xee ku bi taybet\xee di civat\xean ol\xee de t\xea l\xeadan.",lv:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'tewandin' ev e: guhertina pa\u015fgira navd\xear an c\xeenavkan li gor\xee rola wan a di hevok\xea de.",CC:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'xweseriya demokrat\xeek' ev e: modela siyas\xee ya ku t\xea de gel\xean her\xeam\xea saziy\xean xwe bi xwe bir\xeave dibin.",Yk:"Ravekirina rast ji bo 'zanistiya azad' ev e: hi\u015fmendiya zanist\xee ya ku ji bin tekel\xean desthilat\xea derketiye \xfb ji civak\xea re xizmet dike.",mv:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\xc7em\xea Firat\xea' ev e: yek ji du \xe7em\xean her\xee mezin \xean Mezopotamyay\xea ku jiyan\xea dide ax\xean berdar.",x2:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\xc7iyay\xea C\xfbd\xee' ev e: \xe7iyay\xea p\xeeroz \xea ku li gor\xee baweriyan ke\u015ftiya N\xfbh P\xeaxember li ser r\xfbni\u015ftiye.",tF:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\xc7iyay\xea S\xeepan\xea' ev e: \xe7iyay\xea volkan\xeek \xea bilind \xfb berf\xeen \xea li bakur\xea Gola Wan\xea.",eA:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\xcemparatoriya Med\xee' ev e: h\xeaza mezin a antik a li \xe7iyay\xean Zagros\xea ku kurd xwe wek\xee neviy\xean wan dib\xeenin.",Wf:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\xe7anda ko\xe7eriy\xea' ev e: \u015f\xeawaz\xea jiyana kevnar a li ser zozan \xfb germiyan\xea ku \xe7anda kurd\xee pir dewlemend kiriye.",SU:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\xe7iyay\xean Zagros\xea' ev e: r\xeaze\xe7iyay\xean mezin \xfb as\xea y\xean ku s\xeenor\xea xwezay\xee y\xea welat\xea kurdan p\xeak t\xeenin.",sJ:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\u015eakiro' ev e: dengb\xeaj\xea mezin \xea ku wek\xee '\u015eah\xea Dengb\xeajan' t\xea naskirin \xfb xwed\xee dengek\xee b\xeahempa b\xfb.",z3:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\u015eerefname' ev e: pirt\xfbka d\xeeroka m\xeergeh\xean kurd\xee ku di sala 1597an de ji aliy\xea \u015eerefxan\xea Bedl\xees\xee ve hatib\xfb niv\xeesandin.",XW:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\u015fevb\xeark' ev e: civ\xeen\xean \u015fev\xea y\xean zivistan\xea ku t\xea de \xe7\xeerok\xean gel\xear\xee \xfb metelok dihatin gotin.",My:"Ravekirina rast ji bo '\u015fevb\xeark\xean w\xeajey\xee' ev e: civ\xeen\xean \u015fev\xea y\xean ku t\xea de helbest \xfb \xe7\xeerok\xean klas\xeek \xfb modern dihatin xwendin.",wZ:"R\xeazik\xean qan\xfbn\xee \xfb gav\xean entegrasyona demokrat\xeek",aT:"Selahaddin Eyyubi taraf\u0131ndan kurulan b\xfcy\xfck devlet",So:"Serh